# Fable of the Mirror-Breaker's Goblin Shaman is a token; Mirrorweave makes it a copy of Ornithopter until end of turn (CR 707.2).
# Being a token is no copiable value (CR 707.2, 111.1), so it is still a token, now a 0/2 artifact Ornithopter with flying - as
# the ruling has it for a token target, the copying creatures don't become tokens; a token stays one. As the turn ends it is a
# 2/2 Goblin Shaman token again (CR 514.2).

